// Proofs for the identities barista.hana states, in the strategy language of
// docs/proving.md. An identity with no entry here is proved by `diagram`
// alone — this file holds exactly the claims that need direction.

// The contract claim for the customer's `emit`, and the whole of what a
// human has to say about it is which definitions to spend.
//
// What the engine does unaided: builds the case tree over the four internal
// states, runs each leaf's window on the machine, and — the part this claim
// turns on — carries the precondition inward. `is_state::check` proves one
// `and` tree; the postcondition's `is_event::check` re-asks the conjuncts of
// it one at a time, on wires no reordering reaches, and gets them back
// decided. Its sibling in types_test.hana makes the same claim where the
// precondition is a chain of equalities instead.
proof barista::customer_impl::emit_does_pre_and_post_is_constant = inline diagram;
